%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:18 (writeJson-skipNullOn-test)
testing: JSON skipNullOn option
元の形: io/writeJson の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"a": 1, "b": null}, "application/json", {"skipNullOn": "everywhere"})
%%% output application/json
"{\n  \"a\": 1\n}"
